{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAME FEATURES</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Embark on a Unique Adventure</strong></h2>Step into an Eastern-inspired wasteland overworld. Brave the dangers of what remains of civilization, exploring every zone in search of the Core of Creation. Immerse yourself in a rich storyline with diverse equipment and a robust talent system at your disposal.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131860/extras/470a301f996604679bb2e9fcdc2b408d.poster.avif?t=1722500518\" width=624 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131860/extras/470a301f996604679bb2e9fcdc2b408d.webm?t=1722500518\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131860/extras/470a301f996604679bb2e9fcdc2b408d.mp4?t=1722500518\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Find Your Combat Style</strong></h2>Ashfall features 9 distinct shooting styles, each born from a unique blend of talents, equipment, and visceral shooting mechanics. Let nothing stand in your way as you dual-wield machine guns for maximum suppression power, shoot with confidence with the Mozambique drill technique for maximum accuracy, go for a sneakier approach with the stealth style, or choose a more unconventional option. With 9 styles to discover and play around with, you\u2019ll find your ideal way to roam and conquer the wasteland.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131860/extras/1e5e87570f4d4e2f1959e731a39e2d73.poster.avif?t=1722500518\" width=624 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131860/extras/1e5e87570f4d4e2f1959e731a39e2d73.webm?t=1722500518\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131860/extras/1e5e87570f4d4e2f1959e731a39e2d73.mp4?t=1722500518\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Encounter Friends and Foes</strong></h2>The wasteland needs not to be a lonely place. Fortunately for you, you can team up with your friends, build your guild, and undertake uniquely designed challenges, together! But be aware \u2013 you may also face off against other Wanderers in blood-pumping PvP zones. <br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131860/extras/67d799ca01d588a22d9eedb6b07bca8a.poster.avif?t=1722500518\" width=624 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131860/extras/67d799ca01d588a22d9eedb6b07bca8a.webm?t=1722500518\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131860/extras/67d799ca01d588a22d9eedb6b07bca8a.mp4?t=1722500518\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the Secret Realms</strong></h2>For Wanderers who want to venture beyond the boundaries of the overworld, there is more to experience in the Secret Realms, with expansive territories (over 200km!) to explore. You will find intricate puzzles, intense combat events, and many challenging medium- and large-sized bases waiting to be occupied. With a high degree of freedom and combat strategy, the Secret Realms promise a unique gaming experience.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131860/extras/8ad1e1787efed54250c09e9c33decced.poster.avif?t=1722500518\" width=624 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131860/extras/8ad1e1787efed54250c09e9c33decced.webm?t=1722500518\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131860/extras/8ad1e1787efed54250c09e9c33decced.mp4?t=1722500518\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2131860?t=1722500518","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131860/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1722500518","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131860/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1722500518","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131860/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1722500518","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Join our Discord!</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAME FEATURES</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Embark on a Unique Adventure</strong></h2>Step into an Eastern-inspired wasteland overworld. Brave the dangers of what remains of civilization, exploring every zone in search of the Core of Creation. Immerse yourself in a rich storyline with diverse equipment and a robust talent system at your disposal.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131860/extras/470a301f996604679bb2e9fcdc2b408d.poster.avif?t=1722500518\" width=624 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131860/e